{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o077a","title":"官渡相持与土山地道攻防","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o077a-account","label":"正文","text":"袁绍营垒渐进，曹操分营抵抗，交战不利，双方又以土山、地道及弓矢攻守。","evidence":["wudi-e-o077a-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o050a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"袁绍营逼官渡合战曹操不利还壁","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o050a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"进攻筑垒","evidence":["wudi-e-o077a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"防御筑垒","evidence":["wudi-e-o077a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"官渡","evidence":["wudi-e-o077a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安五年八月","year":200,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o077a-q","wudi-q-o071","wudi-q-b-9900125064e5d85f08ad"],"chronology":"wudi-y200","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o071","basis":"建安五年八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,415,"O077a"],"order":182}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o050a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-a2e1cd17fc4fadc62bd0","layer":"original","quote":"连营稍前，逼官渡。合战，太祖军不利，复壁。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":308,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o077a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1c352ef0b3dd554afb44","layer":"original","quote":"八月，绍连营稍前，依沙塠为屯〖11〗，东西数十里。公亦分营，与相当；合战，不利。﹝一﹞时公兵不满万，伤者十二三。﹝二﹞绍复进临官渡，起土山、地道。公亦于内作之，以相应。绍射营中，矢如雨下。行者皆蒙盾，众大惧。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-744e4aee7f5ff14cca85","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o071","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c9f735ddad48a8f5c2b6","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，董承等谋泄，皆伏诛。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
